---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy (draft)"
  description={`Draft privacy page for ${site.name}. Not a finished policy and not a claim of legal compliance.`}
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="legal-draft">Draft</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This page is a draft. It is not a finished privacy policy, it is not legal advice, and it does not claim
        compliance with any law.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What still has to be written</h2>
      <p>
        Before this page can be used, it needs to say what the contact form collects, where those messages are stored,
        who can read them, and how long they are kept. It also needs to name the form service once one is chosen.
        Right now the form is switched off, and the phone number and email on this site are placeholders.
      </p>
      <p>
        A qualified adviser should review the finished text. Until that happens, do not treat this page as a policy
        you can rely on, and do not send sensitive information through the site.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/contact">Back to contact</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
